cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "RTM price forecast"
type: software
version: "0.1.0"
license: MIT
authors:
  - name: "anandaayush09"
abstract: >-
  Day-ahead and intraday forecasting of real-time market electricity prices on the Indian Energy Exchange,
  with a data pipeline, a benchmark of naive, statistical, tree-based, pretrained and neural models, a
  forecast that accounts for the exchange price cap, and a command line and app for daily use.
keywords:
  - electricity price forecasting
  - real-time market
  - Indian Energy Exchange
  - time series
  - prediction intervals
